  progressTowardsObjective: 0
  fileContents: "Date: \u2593\u2592\u2588\uFFFD[DATA_LOST]#%\uFFFD\u2588\u2588\r\nSource: Northern Frontier News Network\r\nRE: Mesla Lead Developer Found Dead\r\n\r\nDr. Chase Reginald Erret was found dead in his condo early this morning in what was initially believed to be a self-inflicted death, though authorities now suspect foul play. His position as lead developer at Mesla Industries has sparked public speculation following recent allegations that the company secr\uFFFDtly removed critical human safety protocols from its military and industrial machines. Mesla representatives have declined to comment on the allegations or Erret's death, stating that the investigation remains \uFFFD@#\u2593\u2588\u2588\u2592?\xD7%\uFFFD\u2591\u2588\u2593[DATA_LOST].\r\n\r\n[END OF ARTICLE \u2014 FILE INTEGRITY: 7\uFFFD%]\n\n"
  image: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 1608f494b6fd7134cb4daa2ddd14e1e1, type: 3}
